ng a brief paint event"],[666,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1460,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[524,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1276,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[985,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1278,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[894,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[737,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[892,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[989,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1280,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1463,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1496,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1462,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[832,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[214,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[213,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[269,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[725,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[211,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[727,"**DOM Output:**"],[672,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1491,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[743,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[731,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[716,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[665,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1283,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[719,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[228,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[240,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[243,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[232,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[831,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[822,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[694,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[734,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[212,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[366,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[365,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[235,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[893,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1574,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[268,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[730,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[230,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[747,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[234,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1464,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[741,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1119,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[663,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[728,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[745,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[738,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1150,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1149,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[895,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1284,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[849,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[729,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[724,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[210,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[241,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1576,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[215,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[239,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[236,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1251,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1252,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1314,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[371,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[270,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[208,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1279,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[891,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[526,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1466,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[987,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1282,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1155,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[370,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[925,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1255,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[723,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[733,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1322,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[986,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[244,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[233,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[673,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[717,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[369,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1152,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1253,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1494,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1492,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1493,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1121,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1552,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1551,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[248,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[237,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[732,"**Trade-offs:**"],[674,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[525,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1277,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[928,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[833,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[217,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[668,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[871,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[735,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[736,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[746,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[990,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1281,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1465,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[988,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[266,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[209,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[242,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[218,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[722,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[149,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[829,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[606,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1158,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1258,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[460,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[372,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1159,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1259,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[374,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1161,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1561,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1260,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[459,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[1084,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[373,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1160,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[457,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1082,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1081,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value"],[456,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[1083